BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_2ebb7a4a-022e-39db-a245-9f4e50f04800.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
